# Per-deployment overrides. On the VPS:
#   cp stellaris-empire-planner.override.env.template stellaris-empire-planner.override.env
# then set whatever this deployment needs. The .override.env file is NOT committed.

# No setting is required. adapter-node 6 (SvelteKit 3) no longer reads ORIGIN: it takes the
# origin from the request's Host header (https assumed), so the reverse proxy must pass Host
# through. An ORIGIN line left over from an older deployment is ignored.
